# Frontend (Vite) environment variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and adjust values as needed.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_.

# Base URL for your backend API. Include the /api suffix.
# When unset or empty, it defaults to '/api' (relative path, recommended for self-hosted Docker and local dev proxy).
# Examples:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
